            "speaker_id": 142396,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, kicking off the Community Eco-Finance Awareness Week project! I've created a first draft of the concept note in A1. The main goal is to plan and execute a week-long event on sustainable finance, integrating our postal and bakery services. Please take a look and share your initial thoughts on the key messages.",
