          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M2",
            "speaker_id": 30806,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Thanks for starting this. The concept in A1 looks solid. From my event management experience, framing it as 'Your Community Hub for a Greener Future' could be a powerful angle. It connects all three services under one umbrella. We should also consider partnering with a local environmental group to boost credibility and turnout.",
            "mentions": [
              142396
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "bulb",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 298367,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "I love that angle! We could tie it into the bakery by offering a special 'Green Future' loaf made with locally sourced ingredients for the week. It would be a tangible example of sustainability for customers.",
