          {
            "msg_id": "M4",
            "speaker_id": 422937,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Concept looks good. From a logistics perspective, we need to define the target audience clearly. Are we aiming for existing customers, families, local businesses, or all of the above? This will impact how we set up the spaces.",
            "mentions": [
              142396
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M5",
            "speaker_id": 85956,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Ok I read the document. What do we mean by 'sustainable finance'? Is that just about green stocks? I need to know what topics to prepare for T2.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M6",
            "speaker_id": 142396,
            "reply_to": "M5",
            "text": "Good question. It's broader than that. Think ethical savings, green loans for home improvements, and responsible investing. We can frame it as 'making your money work for a better planet'. Let's make sure all content aligns with the A3 guidelines to be safe.",
            "mentions": [
              85956
