            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M7",
            "speaker_id": 142396,
            "reply_to": "M4",
            "text": "Excellent point on the audience. I think we should prioritize two main segments: 1) Existing customers who already use one of our services, to encourage cross-promotion, and 2) Local families, who are often interested in community-focused and educational events.",
            "mentions": [
              422937
